    body = "# Mission Archive\n\nAppend-only index of completed missions. Never modify existing rows; never rewrite the header or separator. `Completed` is `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM UTC`.\n\n| Mission ID | Completed | Outcome | Summary |\n|------------|-----------|---------|---------|\n| mission-20260904-01 | 2026-09-04 06:09 UTC | done | Restructured testdata fixtures to match harness memory tree layout. |\n| mission-20261009-02 | 2026-10-09 08:15 UTC | failed | Fixture mission with a two-digit counter. |\n| mission-20261009-10 | 2026-10-09 09:40 UTC | done | Fixture mission with a two-digit counter that is a prefix of -100. |\n| mission-20261009-100 | 2026-10-09 11:05 UTC | failed | Fixture mission with a three-digit counter. |\n| mission-20260907-anom-01 | 2026-09-07 14:02 UTC | done | Fixture mission with a harness-qualified id. |\n"
    sha256 = "c52e3b88420fcad85ac7c1c023819d0855fed3fe25852685e5ad115506903076"
